Seconds":6.12,"text":"Yeah, it actually can."},{"startSeconds":6.18,"endSeconds":11.94,"text":"Brand new from Clinique, this is their smart clinical repair cream with collagen plus PDRN and peptides."},{"startSeconds":12.08,"endSeconds":16.4,"text":"This is clinically proven to target early signs of aging caused by collagen decline."},{"startSeconds":16.5,"endSeconds":20.7,"text":"You're going to use it morning and night, and in just four weeks, you will have improved texture,"},{"startSeconds":20.86,"endSeconds":23.1,"text":"and your skin's going to look and feel bouncier."},{"startSeconds":23.1,"endSeconds":27.6,"text":"It's lightweight, it layers beautifully, and it has this deliciously silky texture."},{"startSeconds":27.74,"endSeconds":28.72,"text":"It feels like a cloud."},{"startSeconds":28.72,"endSeconds":33.94,"text":"The formula is just beautiful, and as always, Clinique is allergy tested and fragrance free."},{"startSeconds":34.02,"endSeconds":35.46,"text":"Get it now at Amazon.com."},{"startSeconds":35.52,"endSeconds":37.08,"text":"You are going to love this."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_78a274133a1065a60ed213cf3e28","position":1,"timestampSeconds":1.3,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7667610436707077407/1_1.30.webp"},{"id":"med_63b9bbdfdc4ac25f07d5e3a5396e","position":2,"timestampSeconds":3.3,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7667610436707077407/2_3.30.webp"},{"id":"med_65a8389c61aaf5ef66b87948d7c5","position":3,"timestampSeconds":8.17,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7667610436707077407/3_8.17.webp"},{"id":"med_c113d2e2855c975a3aa7f1583ac4","position":4,"timestampSeconds":9.4,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7667610436707077407/4_9.40.webp"},{"id":"med_7c8a12b66120a46965fe4eb36422","position":5,"timestampSeconds":10.5,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/tiktok/7667610436707077407/5_10.50.webp"},{"id":"med_3bd5e1c523d7335