,"profileHandle":"ananya_runjhun","profileDisplayName":"Ananya Singh","format":"video","caption":"Comment down for the link cuties! 🔗🩷\n\nIf dark spots, acne marks, uneven skin tone and visible pores are your concern too, this serum deserves a place in your routine. ✨💌 @discover.pilgrim \n\nI’ve been using the Pilgrim 10% Niacinamide Serum, and I love how lightweight it feels while helping my skin look smoother, brighter and more even over time ✨\n\n{ Skincare , Serum , niacinamide , pilgrim serum , acne marks , dark spots , controls oil , minimizes pores ,  brighten skin }\n\n#skincare #serum #pilgrim #niacinamide","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_d3e3d1f996de03a17d0e6ed0f638","publishedAt":"2026-07-27T14:07:39.000Z","profileId":"prf_084e9b98dd671325d5888af569f7","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DbTIzkOhsBg/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":10733078,"likesCount":13156,"sharesCount":2189,"commentsCount":1067,"interactionsCount":16412,"engagementRatePerViews":0.15291046985776122,"engagementRatePerFollowers":6.3842036472272365,"profileFollowersCount":257072,"profileFollowingCount":140,"profilePostsCount":1065,"mediaCount":1,"duration":71.352,"hashtags":["#skincare","#serum","#pilgrim","#niacinamide"],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[{"id":"prf_4c6f3ea43ce66f69c0658f66313d","platformId":"20508782615","profileHandle":"discover.pilgrim"}],"platformId":"DbTIzkOhsBg","profilePlatformId":"3692195292","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/ananya_runjhun/pfp.webp","profileBio":"जाको राखे साइयां मार सके न कोय🙏\n    \n📍 Varanasi \nBusiness 💌 singhananyaa9@gmail.com","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"Hi guys, I ordered a serum from Amazon just to check the hype but there will be so much difference that I didn't expect. You know, some acne marks on my skin, some pores are visible, meaning overall skin was a little dull. And then I tried this 10% Niacinamide serum. There is 10% Niacinamide which helps to make the skin brighter. There is also quajic acid which targets dark spots and tan also fades. Korean rice water gives skin a healthy glass light glow. Honestly, the most important thing is the texture. It's light weight and not sticky. Look, my skin was before and after consistently using it, it's more bright and smooth. This brand has 3 days, acne marks, dark spots, visibly fade. And only 5 days, glow boosts. And only 14 days, pores help to minimize. You know, it has rice exosomes technology which helps to reduce the pores appearance. Plus, it is also tested for sensitive skin. If you find a serum that is glow, acne marks, pore care, then this one is worth it.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.022,"endSeconds":4.102,"text":"Hi guys, I ordered a serum from Amazon just to check the hype"},{"startSeconds":4.102,"endSeconds":8.622,"text":"but there will be so much difference that I didn't expect."},{"startSeconds":8.622,"endSeconds":12.702,"text":"You know, some acne marks on my skin, some pores are visible,"},{"startSeconds":12.702,"endSeconds":15.702,"text":"meaning overall skin was a little dull."},{"startSeconds":15.702,"endSeconds":19.782,"text":"And then I tried this 10% Niacinamide serum."},{"startSeconds":19.782,"endSeconds":23.222,"text":"There is 10% Niacinamide which helps to make the skin brighter."},{"startSeconds":23.222,"endSeconds":27.782,"text":"There is also quajic acid which targets dark spots and tan also fades."},{"startSeconds":27.782,"endSeconds":30.702,"text":"Korean rice water gives skin a healthy glass light glow."},{"startSeconds":30.702,"endSeconds":34.142,"text":"Honestly, the most important thing is the texture."},{"startSeconds":34.142,"endSeconds":36.342,"text":"It's light weight and not sticky."},{"startSeconds":36.342,"endSeconds":39.822,"text":"Look, my skin was before and after consistently using it,"},{"startSeconds":39.822,"endSeconds":42.062,"text":"it's more bright and smooth."},{"startSeconds":42.062,"endSeconds":47.022,"text":"This brand has 3 days, acne marks, dark spots, visibly fade."},{"startSeconds":47.022,"endSeconds":50.342,"text":"And only 5 days, glow boosts."},{"startSeconds":50.342,"endSeconds":54.782,"text":"And only 14 days, pores help to minimize."},{"startSeconds":54.782,"endSeconds":57.702,"text":"You know, it has rice exosomes technology"},{"startSeconds":57.702,"endSeconds":60.542,"text":"which helps to reduce the pores appearance."},{"startSeconds":60.542,"endSeconds":63.142,"text":"Plus, it is also tested for sensitive skin."},{"startSeconds":63.142,"endSeconds":68.262,"text":"If you find a serum that is glow, acne marks, pore care,"},{"startSeconds":68.262,"endSeconds":71.142,"text":"then this one is worth it."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_919057ef58e6ddd251d3e95a4b9d","position":1,"timestampSeconds":1.23,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DbTIzkOhsBg/1_1.23.webp"},{"id":"med_5f1b3cb3cd1a7c0bff90f6ce9e29","position":2,"timestampSeconds":1.27,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DbTIzkOhsBg/2_1.27.webp"},{"id":"med_8717a5cd07d029b5d8ae0e5c9dcc","position":3,"timestampSeconds":4.63,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DbTIzkOhsBg/3_4.63.webp"},{"id":"med_10be086b900718668c0a4fbc7b41","position":4,"timestampSeconds":8.7,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DbTIzkOhsBg/4_8.70.webp"},{"id":"med_363ff0c7b890abf4a269978f8940","position":5,"timestampSeconds":8.77,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DbTIzkOhsBg/5_8.77.webp"},{"id":"med_de91d5cf8e37e62bfd9be65ecf07","position":6,"timestampSeconds":10.27,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazon